# check_motion_blocks.gd's sheet: motion blocks, run by the simulation (docs/rules-language.md).

# A dive, then on the ground: what it says depends on a field, decided when the landing starts.
motion Slam on press slam if not grounded
	cooldown 2
	lasts 3
	emit slam.started
	impulse 25 along world direction (0, -1, 0) replace vertical
	move gravity 30
	then when grounded within 2
	emit slam.landed
	if slam.big > 0
		emit slam.big_landed
		move for 0.5 walk_speed 0
	else
		emit slam.small_landed
		if slam.loud
			emit slam.loud
	change slam.count += 1
	timeout
	emit slam.missed

# Once, as it turns true.
motion Land when grounded if not motion.Slam
	emit landed

# By time, and an end.
motion Later on press later
	uses 2 refill after 3
	emit later.a
	after 0.5
	emit later.b
	if later.stop
		end
	move for 1 friction 0

on slam.landed
	shake 0.3
